===Etymology===
From {{inh|tr|ota|بالق|tr=balık|t=fish}}, from Old Turkic ''bal-'' ("to cling, to be runny") + suffix ''-ik'',<ref>{{R:tr:Nişanyan}}</ref>, {{inh+|tr|trk-pro|*bālïk|t=fish}}.

